# DECISIONS.log — append-only. New entries at the bottom: date · decision · why · alternative rejected.

2026-05→08 · Clean-room provenance: designed from USALI 12th, HTNG/OpenTravel, public modern-PMS APIs. No Oracle/OPERA materials, docs, or screenshots — derivative-work risk.
2026-08 · Folio belongs to ACCOUNT, not reservation. Reservation links to folios. (Round-1 finding; retrofit after launch would be a ledger migration.)
2026-08 · Occupancy = claim ranges: exclusive [0,∞), bed [p,p+1); ONE gist EXCLUDE arbitrates all conflicts. Rejected: partial constraint per mode — FAILED stress test T2 (double-sell).
2026-08 · Advisory lock in record_occupancy is per-space throughput aid only; constraint is correctness. Mega-dorms modeled as multiple spaces.
2026-08 · Insert-only + bitemporal for financials/rates/occupancy/config via fact_log. Corrections reference, never mutate.
2026-08 · Continuous day-close: roll is automatic (scheduler, property-local cutoff); seal is async; discrepancies carry forward via approval. Rejected: blocking night audit.
2026-08 · Multi-tenancy: shared-schema RLS + dedicated-DB upsell. Rejected: schema-per-tenant middle tier (ops cost, migration fan-out).
2026-08 · RLS context via set_config(..., true) — transaction-local, PgBouncer-safe. Session SET forbidden.
2026-08 · Views MUST carry security_invoker=true; §14 loop enforces on all. (Empirically proven leak without it — TC-13.4 permanent.)
2026-08 · Choke point: space_occupancy writes only via SECURITY DEFINER fns; direct DML revoked (42501 by design).
2026-08 · Event delivery: transactional outbox, polled 100–250 ms, partial index + aggressive autovacuum + prune_outbox(30d). Rejected: LISTEN/NOTIFY as delivery (PgBouncer), CDC/logical replication (WAL-retention footgun for a 2-person team), Kafka/Redpanda (scale we don't have).
2026-08 · NATS deferred behind EventBus interface; in-process consumers read outbox by seq with cursor rows (push_cursor pattern). Trigger: first out-of-process consumer or second node. Valkey vs NATS-KV: Phase-2 p99 A/B decides.
2026-08 · Stack: TypeScript/Bun/Elysia modular monolith, 13 contexts, index.ts-only surfaces. Rejected: Rust/Go/Elixir (velocity, type expressiveness, hiring), microservices (distributed tax).
2026-08 · Bun-native: Bun.sql, Bun.password (argon2id), built-in WS/SSE, Bun.S3 for R2. Fewer deps, zero cost.
2026-08 · JSONB hot-column hybrid for space attributes; GIN only for @> queries; availability predicates get real columns. (~50,000× measured difference vs naive EAV/->> paths.)
2026-08 · Money = bigint minor units + char(3). Ranges half-open [). tenant_id first column, leads every index.
2026-08 · slot_kind ∈ {segment, hold, ooo}: occupancy hangs off reservation_segments; a move = new segment.
2026-08 · Rates: rate_price insert-only + superseded_by; current reads via partial indexes (rate_current_*); overlap precedence = latest recorded_at; weekday/weekend overlaps legal (dow_mask), so no range-EXCLUDE there.
2026-08 · Distribution: direct Booking.com + Expedia partner APIs first (certification is calendar-gated — apply immediately). RateGain = long-tail trigger. Bed-level OTA aggregation for dorms.
2026-08 · Fiscal: in-house ZATCA (clearance) + India IRP (reporting); UAE legally provider-routed via ASP (accreditation requires 2-yr operational solution). Buy trigger: jurisdiction #3. Provider port has 5 modes incl. peppol.
2026-08 · India GST slabs per room-night on transaction value (CBIC 15/2025): ≤₹1,000 exempt · ₹1,001–7,500 @5% no ITC · >₹7,500 @18% ITC.
2026-08 · Statutory registration = own bounded context; adapters as extension rows (IT Alloggiati 168-char/24h, PT SIBA, IN Form-C, HR eVisitor). Missing fields block check-in per property country.
2026-08 · GDPR erasure = party anonymisation; financial/statutory rows preserved (Art. 17(3)(b)). Identity docs pgcrypto-encrypted, retention per country.
2026-08 · Payments token-only (SAQ-A). UPI via upi_clearing account role, zero-MDR rails.
2026-08 · Trust accounting = account role + automations; commingling forbidden; negative requires approval.
2026-08 · Zero-cost v3: OCI Always Free ×2 tenancies (primary+replica), R2/B2 encrypted backups, Cloudflare Tunnel+Turnstile, Caddy, GlitchTip, Uptime Kuma. One precious datastore: only PG is stateful; everything else rebuildable, drilled monthly. Launch run cost ₹0–4k/mo.
2026-08 · Spend triggers: Hetzner ₹4k post-revenue · managed PG if ops>budget 2 mo · fiscal provider @#3 · channel mgr @long-tail · ClickHouse when DuckDB>seconds · failover+SSO/SAML @first enterprise SLA.
2026-08 · UI: three-tier surfaces (peek/drawer/workbench), keyboard grammar, deep links, three undo verbs (undo/correction/reversal), offline pre-leased hold pool. No modal-over-modal. UI speaks CONTRACTS.md only.
2026-08 · QA: executable invariant battery (tests/) must stay green from Phase 2; first full run 11/11 PASS. Paper review ≠ verification — three defects found only by execution.

